# Not written:
#   implied allow egress+allow-https-web-v6: no IPv4 address as the source
#   allow-https-web-v6: no IPv4 address as the source
#   allow-mgmt-v6: its services cannot be written: an ICMP type, ICMPv6, SCTP or another IP protocol: a custom service of Cato is TCP, UDP or ICMP
